{"seq":2,"slug":"yjs-and-automerge","title":"Yjs 与 Automerge","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/yjs-and-automerge","wordCount":1412,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"yjs-与-automerge\">Yjs 与 Automerge</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Yjs（Kevin Jahns，2015）和 Automerge（Martin Kleppmann，2017）是 JavaScript 中最成熟的 CRDT 库——将抽象的 CRDT 数学转化为生产就绪的 API。Yjs 采用高性能的命令式 API（Y.Map、Y.Text、Y.Array），被 Liveblocks、Tiptap、JupyterLab 使用。Automerge 采用函数式/不可变的类 JSON API，被 Local-First Cooperative 项目使用。两者各有取舍——Yjs 更快、体积更小，Automerge API 更简洁、原生支持分支/复刻。本节介绍 Yjs API、Automerge API、对比分析以及实战搭建（React + WebSocket + IndexedDB 持久化）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Yjs</th>\n<th>Automerge</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>极高（深度优化）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>约 50 KB</td>\n<td>约 200 KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 风格</td>\n<td>命令式共享类型</td>\n<td>函数式不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支支持</td>\n<td>非原生</td>\n<td>原生支持（类 Git）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用者</td>\n<td>Tiptap、Liveblocks、Jupyter</td>\n<td>Local-First、Pushpin</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"yjs-基础配置\">Yjs 基础配置</h2><p><strong>安装</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i yjs y-websocket y-indexeddb\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yjs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> y-websocket</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> y-indexeddb</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>创建文档</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import * as Y from &#39;yjs&#39;;&#10;import { WebsocketProvider } from &#39;y-websocket&#39;;&#10;import { IndexeddbPersistence } from &#39;y-indexeddb&#39;;&#10;&#10;const doc = new Y.Doc();&#10;&#10;// 本地持久化&#10;const persistence = new IndexeddbPersistence(&#39;my-doc&#39;, doc);&#10;&#10;// 通过 WebSocket 同步&#10;const provider = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;wss://example.com&#39;, &#39;room1&#39;, doc);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Y from 'yjs';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebsocketProvider } from 'y-websocket';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { IndexeddbPersistence } from 'y-indexeddb';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const doc = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 本地持久化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const persistence = new IndexeddbPersistence('my-doc', doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 通过 WebSocket 同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const provider = new WebsocketProvider('wss://example.com', 'room1', doc);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"yjs-共享类型\">Yjs 共享类型</h2><p><strong>Y.Map</strong>（键值对）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const map = doc.getMap(&#39;settings&#39;);&#10;map.set(&#39;theme&#39;, &#39;dark&#39;);&#10;console.log(map.get(&#39;theme&#39;)); // &#39;dark&#39;&#10;&#10;map.observe((event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Changed:&#39;, event.changes);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const map = doc.getMap('settings');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map.set('theme', 'dark');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(map.get('theme')); // 'dark'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>map.observe((event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('Changed:', event.changes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Y.Array</strong>（列表）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const arr = doc.getArray(&#39;todos&#39;);&#10;arr.push([&#39;Buy milk&#39;]);&#10;arr.delete(0, 1); // 从索引 0 删除 1 个元素&#10;console.log(arr.toArray());&#10;&#10;arr.observe((event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Changed:&#39;, event.changes);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const arr = doc.getArray('todos');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>arr.push(['Buy milk']);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>arr.delete(0, 1); // 从索引 0 删除 1 个元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(arr.toArray());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>arr.observe((event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('Changed:', event.changes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Y.Text</strong>（协作文本）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const text = doc.getText(&#39;content&#39;);&#10;text.insert(0, &#39;Hello &#39;);&#10;text.insert(6, &#39;World&#39;);&#10;console.log(text.toString()); // &#39;Hello World&#39;&#10;&#10;text.observe((event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Changed:&#39;, event.delta); // Delta 格式&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const text = doc.getText('content');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>text.insert(0, 'Hello ');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>text.insert(6, 'World');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(text.toString()); // 'Hello World'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>text.observe((event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('Changed:', event.delta); // Delta 格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Y.XmlFragment</strong>（富文本）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const xml = doc.getXmlFragment(&#39;article&#39;);&#10;const para = new Y.XmlElement(&#39;p&#39;);&#10;xml.push([para]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const xml = doc.getXmlFragment('article');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const para = new Y.XmlElement('p');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>xml.push([para]);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"yjs-事务\">Yjs 事务</h2><p><strong>分组操作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"doc.transact(() =&gt; {&#10;  map.set(&#39;a&#39;, 1);&#10;  map.set(&#39;b&#39;, 2);&#10;  arr.push([&#39;x&#39;, &#39;y&#39;]);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 事务结束后只触发一次观察回调\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>doc.transact(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map.set('a', 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  map.set('b', 2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  arr.push(['x', 'y']);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 事务结束后只触发一次观察回调</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>性能优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>减少观察回调触发次数。</li>\n<li>操作原子化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"yjs-更新同步\">Yjs 更新同步</h2><p><strong>编码更新数据</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const update = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc);&#10;// 发送给服务器或其他对等方\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const update = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 发送给服务器或其他对等方</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>应用更新数据</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"Y.applyUpdate(doc, update);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Y.applyUpdate(doc, update);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>状态向量（增量同步）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const stateVector = Y.encodeStateVector(doc);&#10;// 发送给对等方&#10;const updateForPeer = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc, stateVector);&#10;// 对等方应用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const stateVector = Y.encodeStateVector(doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 发送给对等方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const updateForPeer = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc, stateVector);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 对等方应用</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅发送对方缺少的数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"y-websocket-提供者\">y-websocket 提供者</h2><p><strong>自动通过 WebSocket 同步</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const provider = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;wss://example.com&#39;, &#39;room1&#39;, doc);&#10;&#10;provider.on(&#39;status&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(event.status); // connected 或 disconnected&#10;});&#10;&#10;provider.awareness.setLocalStateField(&#39;user&#39;, {&#10;  name: &#39;Alice&#39;,&#10;  color: &#39;#ff0000&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const provider = new WebsocketProvider('wss://example.com', 'room1', doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provider.on('status', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(event.status); // connected 或 disconnected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provider.awareness.setLocalStateField('user', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'Alice',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  color: '#ff0000',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>在线感知（Awareness）</strong>：光标、选区等临时状态独立于文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"y-indexeddb-持久化\">y-indexeddb 持久化</h2><p><strong>本地持久化</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { IndexeddbPersistence } from &#39;y-indexeddb&#39;;&#10;&#10;const persistence = new IndexeddbPersistence(&#39;my-doc&#39;, doc);&#10;&#10;persistence.on(&#39;synced&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;已从 IndexedDB 加载&#39;);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { IndexeddbPersistence } from 'y-indexeddb';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const persistence = new IndexeddbPersistence('my-doc', doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>persistence.on('synced', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('已从 IndexedDB 加载');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文档自动保存。</li>\n<li>刷新页面后从 IndexedDB 恢复。</li>\n<li>实现离线优先。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"yjs-react\">Yjs + React</h2><p><strong>使用自定义 Hook</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"function useY(yArray) {&#10;  const [state, setState] = useState(yArray.toArray());&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const update = () =&gt; setState(yArray.toArray());&#10;    yArray.observe(update);&#10;    return () =&gt; yArray.unobserve(update);&#10;  }, [yArray]);&#10;  return state;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function useY(yArray) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [state, setState] = useState(yArray.toArray());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const update = () => setState(yArray.toArray());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    yArray.observe(update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => yArray.unobserve(update);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [yArray]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"yjs-与-tiptap\">Yjs 与 Tiptap</h2><p><strong>富文本编辑器集成</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { Editor } from &#39;@tiptap/react&#39;;&#10;import Collaboration from &#39;@tiptap/extension-collaboration&#39;;&#10;&#10;const editor = new Editor({&#10;  extensions: [&#10;    Collaboration.configure({&#10;      document: doc,&#10;      field: &#39;content&#39;, // Y.Doc 中的字段名&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Editor } from '@tiptap/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import Collaboration from '@tiptap/extension-collaboration';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const editor = new Editor({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  extensions: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Collaboration.configure({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      document: doc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      field: 'content', // Y.Doc 中的字段名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多人实时协作富文本编辑。</li>\n<li>通过 Yjs 自动同步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"automerge-基础配置\">Automerge 基础配置</h2><p><strong>安装</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i @automerge/automerge\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @automerge/automerge</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>基本用法</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import * as Automerge from &#39;@automerge/automerge&#39;;&#10;&#10;let doc1 = Automerge.from({ tasks: [], settings: {} });&#10;&#10;// 通过 change 回调修改&#10;doc1 = Automerge.change(doc1, &#39;Add task&#39;, (d) =&gt; {&#10;  d.tasks.push({ id: 1, text: &#39;Buy milk&#39; });&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 保存为二进制&#10;const binary = Automerge.save(doc1);&#10;&#10;// 加载&#10;const doc2 = Automerge.load(binary);&#10;&#10;// 合并来自另一个对等方的文档&#10;let docA = Automerge.from({ list: [] });&#10;let docB = Automerge.merge(Automerge.init(), docA); // 克隆&#10;&#10;docA = Automerge.change(docA, (d) =&gt; d.list.push(&#39;a&#39;));&#10;docB = Automerge.change(docB, (d) =&gt; d.list.push(&#39;b&#39;));&#10;&#10;// 并发编辑后合并&#10;const merged = Automerge.merge(docA, docB);&#10;console.log(merged.list); // [&#39;a&#39;, &#39;b&#39;]（或 [&#39;b&#39;, &#39;a&#39;]，取决于顺序）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Automerge from '@automerge/automerge';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let doc1 = Automerge.from({ tasks: [], settings: {} });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 通过 change 回调修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>doc1 = Automerge.change(doc1, 'Add task', (d) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  d.tasks.push({ id: 1, text: 'Buy milk' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 保存为二进制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const binary = Automerge.save(doc1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const doc2 = Automerge.load(binary);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 合并来自另一个对等方的文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let docA = Automerge.from({ list: [] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let docB = Automerge.merge(Automerge.init(), docA); // 克隆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>docA = Automerge.change(docA, (d) => d.list.push('a'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>docB = Automerge.change(docB, (d) => d.list.push('b'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 并发编辑后合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const merged = Automerge.merge(docA, docB);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(merged.list); // ['a', 'b']（或 ['b', 'a']，取决于顺序）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"automerge-同步协议\">Automerge 同步协议</h2><p><strong>自动同步</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 对等方 A&#10;let syncState = Automerge.initSyncState();&#10;const [newState, message] = Automerge.generateSyncMessage(doc, syncState);&#10;syncState = newState;&#10;sendToB(message);&#10;&#10;// 对等方 B&#10;const [doc2, syncState2, patch] = Automerge.receiveSyncMessage(doc, syncState, message);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 对等方 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let syncState = Automerge.initSyncState();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const [newState, message] = Automerge.generateSyncMessage(doc, syncState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>syncState = newState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sendToB(message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 对等方 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const [doc2, syncState2, patch] = Automerge.receiveSyncMessage(doc, syncState, message);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>双向同步</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>双方交换同步消息直到收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"yjs-与-automerge-对比\">Yjs 与 Automerge 对比</h2><p><strong>Yjs</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优点：<ul>\n<li>性能极高。</li>\n<li>包体积小（约 50 KB）。</li>\n<li>生态成熟。</li>\n<li>与 Tiptap、Liveblocks 深度集成。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>缺点：<ul>\n<li>命令式 API 直观性稍弱。</li>\n<li>不原生支持分支。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Automerge</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优点：<ul>\n<li>函数式/不可变 API（清晰简洁）。</li>\n<li>原生支持分支/复刻（类 Git 工作流）。</li>\n<li>类 JSON 接口。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>缺点：<ul>\n<li>速度较慢。</li>\n<li>包体积大（约 200 KB）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产环境协作应用：Yjs。</li>\n<li>本地优先应用：Automerge。</li>\n<li>实时协作编辑器：Yjs（配合 Tiptap）。</li>\n<li>需要文档分支功能：Automerge。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CRDT 库选择] --&gt; B{使用场景}&#10;    B -- 实时协作编辑器 --&gt; C[Yjs]&#10;    B -- 本地优先 + 分支 --&gt; D[Automerge]&#10;    B -- 追求高性能 --&gt; C&#10;    B -- 优先 API 简洁性 --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[CRDT 库选择] --&gt; B{使用场景}\n    B -- 实时协作编辑器 --&gt; C[Yjs]\n    B -- 本地优先 + 分支 --&gt; D[Automerge]\n    B -- 追求高性能 --&gt; C\n    B -- 优先 API 简洁性 --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"持久化策略\">持久化策略</h2><p><strong>Yjs</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>y-indexeddb（浏览器端）。</li>\n<li>y-leveldb（Node.js 端）。</li>\n<li>服务端：自定义数据库存储更新二进制数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Automerge</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接保存二进制数据。</li>\n<li>自定义数据库集成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"服务器架构\">服务器架构</h2><p><strong>y-websocket-server</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开箱即用的服务器。</li>\n<li>通过回调持久化到数据库或文件。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { WebSocketServer } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;import { setupWSConnection } from &#39;y-websocket/bin/utils&#39;;&#10;&#10;const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 1234 });&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws, req) =&gt; {&#10;  setupWSConnection(ws, req, {&#10;    persist: async (docName, doc) =&gt; {&#10;      // 保存 Y.Doc 到数据库&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebSocketServer } from 'ws';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { setupWSConnection } from 'y-websocket/bin/utils';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 1234 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wss.on('connection', (ws, req) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setupWSConnection(ws, req, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    persist: async (docName, doc) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 保存 Y.Doc 到数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"离线优先架构\">离线优先架构</h2><p><strong>Yjs + IndexedDB + WebSocket</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const doc = new Y.Doc();&#10;&#10;// 先加载本地持久化数据&#10;const persistence = new IndexeddbPersistence(&#39;doc-id&#39;, doc);&#10;&#10;// 然后建立在线同步&#10;persistence.on(&#39;synced&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const provider = new WebsocketProvider(&#39;wss://...&#39;, &#39;room&#39;, doc);&#10;  // 在线时文档自动同步到服务器&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const doc = new Y.Doc();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 先加载本地持久化数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const persistence = new IndexeddbPersistence('doc-id', doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 然后建立在线同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>persistence.on('synced', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const provider = new WebsocketProvider('wss://...', 'room', doc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 在线时文档自动同步到服务器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>离线时本地编辑。</li>\n<li>在线后自动同步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"内存管理\">内存管理</h2><p><strong>Yjs 垃圾回收</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const doc = new Y.Doc({ gc: true }); // 默认开启\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const doc = new Y.Doc({ gc: true }); // 默认开启</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>GC 功能</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>移除已删除元素的墓碑。</li>\n<li>对大文档有显著内存收益。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>如需保留编辑历史可关闭</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const doc = new Y.Doc({ gc: false }); // 保留全部历史\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const doc = new Y.Doc({ gc: false }); // 保留全部历史</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>1. 不使用事务</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导致多次触发观察回调。</li>\n<li>应使用 doc.transact()。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 直接修改代理对象</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yjs 必须使用共享类型 API（如 Y.Map.set）。</li>\n<li>不能用普通 JavaScript 对象的赋值操作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不做持久化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>刷新页面后离线编辑丢失。</li>\n<li>应使用 IndexedDB。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 在 Y.Doc 中存储大型二进制数据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不应将图片等二进制数据存入文档。</li>\n<li>应通过 URL 引用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 快照更新体积膨胀</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应使用状态向量做增量同步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代工具链\">现代工具链</h2><p><strong>Liveblocks</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 Yjs 构建。</li>\n<li>提供 React Hooks。</li>\n<li>托管基础设施。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HocusPocus</strong>（Tiptap 出品）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yjs 服务器。</li>\n<li>可插拔的持久化层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Loro</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2024 年新 CRDT 库。</li>\n<li>Rust + JS 绑定。</li>\n<li>极快且体积小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战搭建\">实战搭建</h2><p><strong>Tiptap 协作编辑器</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm i @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/extension-collaboration y-websocket yjs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @tiptap/react</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @tiptap/starter-kit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @tiptap/extension-collaboration</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> y-websocket</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yjs</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"jsx\" data-code=\"import { useEditor, EditorContent } from &#39;@tiptap/react&#39;;&#10;import StarterKit from &#39;@tiptap/starter-kit&#39;;&#10;import Collaboration from &#39;@tiptap/extension-collaboration&#39;;&#10;import * as Y from &#39;yjs&#39;;&#10;import { WebsocketProvider } from &#39;y-websocket&#39;;&#10;&#10;function Editor() {&#10;  const ydoc = useMemo(() =&gt; new Y.Doc(), []);&#10;  const provider = useMemo(() =&gt; new WebsocketProvider(&#39;wss://...&#39;, &#39;room&#39;, ydoc), [ydoc]);&#10;&#10;  const editor = useEditor({&#10;    extensions: [&#10;      StarterKit.configure({ history: false }), // 由 Yjs 管理历史&#10;      Collaboration.configure({ document: ydoc }),&#10;    ],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return &lt;EditorContent editor={editor} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useEditor, EditorContent } from '@tiptap/react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import StarterKit from '@tiptap/starter-kit';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import Collaboration from '@tiptap/extension-collaboration';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import * as Y from 'yjs';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebsocketProvider } from 'y-websocket';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Editor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ydoc = useMemo(() => new Y.Doc(), []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const provider = useMemo(() => new WebsocketProvider('wss://...', 'room', ydoc), [ydoc]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const editor = useEditor({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    extensions: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      StarterKit.configure({ history: false }), // 由 Yjs 管理历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Collaboration.configure({ document: ydoc }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;EditorContent editor={editor} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 非协作数据使用 Yjs</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不必要的开销，应使用普通状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 高性能场景使用 Automerge</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>速度较慢，Yjs 更合适。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 重新发明 CRDT</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接使用 Yjs 或 Automerge。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 不配置持久化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>离线编辑会丢失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 单个 Y.Doc 存储海量数据</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>内存膨胀。</li>\n<li>应按资源拆分文档。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 默认选择 Yjs</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生产环境充分验证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 富文本用 Tiptap</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最佳的协作编辑器技术栈。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 光标功能用 Liveblocks</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>免去手动配置在线感知。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 配置 IndexedDB 持久化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实现离线优先。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 监控文档大小</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>关注 Y.encodeStateAsUpdate 的长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 测试多标签页场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同一用户多个标签页同时编辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Yjs（2015）和 Automerge（2017）是 JavaScript 中最主流的 CRDT 库——将抽象数学转化为生产级 API。Yjs 采用高性能命令式共享类型（Y.Map / Y.Array / Y.Text / Y.XmlFragment），包体积约 50 KB，被 Tiptap、Liveblocks、JupyterLab 使用。Automerge 采用函数式/不可变的类 JSON API，原生支持分支，包体积约 200 KB，适用于本地优先项目。Yjs 配置包括 y-websocket 提供者实时同步 + y-indexeddb 本地持久化 + 共享类型 API + 事务分组。更新同步通过 encodeStateAsUpdate（完整）和 encodeStateVector（增量）实现。在线感知（Awareness）管理光标/选区等临时状态，独立于文档。Yjs 与 React 通过自定义 Hook 桥接，与 Tiptap 通过 Collaboration 扩展集成。Automerge 通过 change 回调修改、save/load 序列化、merge 合并并发编辑，同步协议使用 generateSyncMessage/receiveSyncMessage 双向交换。选择建议：生产协作/实时编辑器用 Yjs，本地优先/需要分支用 Automerge。持久化策略：Yjs 用 y-indexeddb（浏览器）/y-leveldb（服务端）/自定义数据库；Automerge 直接保存二进制。离线优先架构先加载本地数据再建立在线同步。内存管理通过 gc:true 回收墓碑。现代工具链包括 Liveblocks、HocusPocus 和 Loro。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Yjs 与 Automerge","id":"yjs-与-automerge"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 基础配置","id":"yjs-基础配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 共享类型","id":"yjs-共享类型"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 事务","id":"yjs-事务"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 更新同步","id":"yjs-更新同步"},{"level":2,"text":"y-websocket 提供者","id":"y-websocket-提供者"},{"level":2,"text":"y-indexeddb 持久化","id":"y-indexeddb-持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs + React","id":"yjs-react"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 与 Tiptap","id":"yjs-与-tiptap"},{"level":2,"text":"Automerge 基础配置","id":"automerge-基础配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Automerge 同步协议","id":"automerge-同步协议"},{"level":2,"text":"Yjs 与 Automerge 对比","id":"yjs-与-automerge-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化策略","id":"持久化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"服务器架构","id":"服务器架构"},{"level":2,"text":"离线优先架构","id":"离线优先架构"},{"level":2,"text":"内存管理","id":"内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"现代工具链","id":"现代工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"实战搭建","id":"实战搭建"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CRDT 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/crdt-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"操作变换（OT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/collaborative-data/operational-transform"}}